    "Hide Others": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏其他"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide the background behind a layer mask, keeping the foreground subjects. The pixels stay, so the background can be painted back at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用图层蒙版遮住背景、保留主体。像素不会删除，随时可以再画回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight Clipping Indicator": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高光剪切指示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight Priority protects bright edges. Color Priority also reduces color. Paint Overlay covers the edges evenly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高光优先保护明亮边缘；颜色优先同时降低饱和度；叠加覆盖则均匀压暗边缘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight Recovery": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高光恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlights": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高光"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Histogram": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直方图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold Shift to add or Option to subtract for one outline": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住 Shift 加选、按住 Option 减选，只针对一次轮廓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright a light has to be to flare; near 100, only the biggest, brightest spots": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "产生耀斑所需的亮度；接近 100 时只有最大最亮的光点才会出现"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright a light has to be to sparkle; near 100, only the biggest, brightest spots": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "产生星芒所需的亮度；接近 100 时只有最大最亮的光点才会出现"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright the lines are where the picture is black, so they show even over black": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面全黑处线条的亮度，使其在纯黑上仍可见"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How brightly lights open into discs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光源散开成光斑的亮度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far a color may be from the picked ones and still be selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "颜色与已拾取颜色的差异在此范围内仍会被选中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the copies are": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重影之间的间距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the screen's lines are": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫描线的间距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far each color channel (0–255) can differ from the clicked color and still be selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各颜色通道 (0–255) 与点按处颜色的差异在此范围内仍会被选中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far out of focus: the size of each disc": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "失焦程度：每个光斑的大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the blur softens, in pixels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模糊柔化的范围，单位为像素"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the brightness is smoothed before it displaces the lines, from sharp ridges to rounded hills": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮度在推移线条前的平滑程度：从锐利的脊线到圆缓的丘陵"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the colors spread apart, red one way and blue the other": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "颜色分离的距离，红蓝各朝一侧"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the lens's coatings turn each streak blue along its length; none keeps the light's own color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "镜头镀膜使光条沿长度方向偏蓝的程度；最低时保持光源本色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the light spreads": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光线的扩散范围"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the light wraps around the subject's edges": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光线环绕主体边缘的范围"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the spikes reach": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "星芒的延伸长度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the streaks reach across the picture": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光条横跨画面的长度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How fine the detail it sharpens: small for crisp texture, larger for a punchier look": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "锐化的细节尺度：数值小则质感清晰，数值大则更具冲击力"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long each frame shows": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每帧显示时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many spikes each light has, as the lens's aperture blades make them": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个光源的星芒数，如同镜头光圈叶片造成的样子"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many times the picture echoes, each fainter": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面的重影次数，一次比一次淡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much light scatters: a soft halo around bright areas, and gently lifted shadows": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光线散射的程度：亮部周围出现柔和光晕，暗部被轻轻提亮"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of each pixel's error spreads to its neighbors. Less gives flatter areas": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个像素的误差向邻近扩散的比例；越小则色块越平"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the gap a bright line fills; dimmer parts draw it thinner": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮线占据间隙的比例；较暗处画得更细"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How strongly edges and fine detail are brought out": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "边缘与细节被强调的强度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the light ends on the inside: low feathers it off softly from the edge, high holds it bright and ends it crisply": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光在内侧的收束方式：低值从边缘柔和淡出，高值保持明亮并干脆收住"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the line's ends, and each of its dashes and dots, are finished": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "线条两端以及每一段虚线和点的收尾方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue and saturation of this wheel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该色轮的色相与饱和度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue around the wheel, saturation outward from the center. Control-click to show the histogram.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相沿圆周分布，饱和度由中心向外递增。按住 Control 点按可显示直方图。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue shifts the color, Saturation its strength, and Luminance its brightness.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相改变颜色，饱和度改变浓淡，明亮度改变明暗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue/Saturation…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相/饱和度…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Image": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图像"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Image Size": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图像大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Image Size…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图像大小…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Images": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图像"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import": {
      "localizations": {
