    "Smooth selection edges; turn off for hard pixel edges": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "平滑选区边缘；关闭后得到硬像素边缘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Smooth the detected object outline; turn off for the raw pixel mask": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "平滑检测到的对象轮廓；关闭则使用原始像素蒙版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Smoothing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "平滑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Smooths grain, at the cost of fine detail": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "平滑颗粒，但会损失细节"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snap": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对齐"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snap To": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对齐到"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soften the copies, more the farther they're pushed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "柔化重影，偏移越远越模糊"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Solid, dashed or dotted; dashes grow with the line's width": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实线、虚线或点线；虚线段随线宽增大"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Split each copy's red and blue apart, as glass does; 0 keeps the copies crisp": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "像玻璃那样分离每个重影的红蓝；0 保持重影清晰"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Split the layer's original channels into four grayscale layers, Red, Green, Blue and Alpha, for Export As › Channel Pack. Color under fully transparent pixels can't be recovered": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把图层的原始通道拆成红、绿、蓝、Alpha 四个灰度图层，用于「导出为 › 通道打包」。完全透明像素下的颜色无法恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Split to Layers": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拆分到图层"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spot Healing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "污点修复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start of the hue range, in degrees.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相范围的起点，单位为度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strength": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "强度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stroke": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "描边"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strong Contrast": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "强对比度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Style": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "样式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subdivisions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "细分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subject": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主体"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swap From and To: blur the start and sharpen toward the end": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "交换起点与终点：让起点模糊、向终点逐渐清晰"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swap colors": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "交换颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swap foreground and background (X)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "交换前景色和背景色 (X)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Targeted Adjustment": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标调整"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Targeted adjustment": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标调整"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Targeted adjustment: drag on the image to change that color's saturation, or its hue with Command held": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标调整：在图像上拖移可改变该颜色的饱和度，按住 Command 则改变色相"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text fields keep standard macOS editing keys. Dialogs share the Apply/Cancel assignments above. Numeric fields use Up/Down, with Shift for larger steps. Standard macOS commands include ⌘Q to quit and ⌃⌘F for full screen. The shortcut editor itself always uses Return to save and Esc to cancel when not recording.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本栏沿用 macOS 标准编辑按键。对话框共用上面的「应用/取消」快捷键。数值栏使用上/下方向键，按住 Shift 可加大步长。macOS 标准命令包括 ⌘Q 退出与 ⌃⌘F 全屏。快捷键编辑器在未录制时始终以 Return 存储、Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The aperture's shape: round wide open, a hexagon of blades, an anamorphic oval, or a cat's eye toward the edges": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光圈形状：全开时的圆形、六边形叶片、变形宽银幕的椭圆，或边缘处的猫眼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The blur where the line ends, and past it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直线终点及其外侧的模糊量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The blur where the line starts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直线起点处的模糊量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The brush trails the pointer on a string this long, so a shaky hand still draws a smooth line": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画笔像被这么长的线牵着跟随指针，手抖也能画出平滑的线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The characters to draw with, in any order: each spot gets the one whose ink best matches its tone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于绘制的字符，顺序不限：每个位置使用墨色最接近其色调的那个字符"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The height of each line of characters": {
